    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesnt change the reality. he deserves to have a partner who can actually do things with him, not someone he has to manage. sometimes i look at him sleeping and all i can think is how much more light there would be in his life if he didn't have this weight constantly pulling at him. if i wasn't here, he could actually breathe again.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
