      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how painfully real this sacrifice feels for you, and it is a testament to your deep love that you want nothing but the best—even if that aspiration means you wish for a different reality. While guilt is a natural human emotion, framing your presence as a permanent obstacle steals meaning from this difficult journey and can make both of you deal with the pressure unsustainably. Please reach out to a counselor who specializes in caregiver distress to help you process these intense feelings before they become overwhelming.",
      "source": "target",
