    "summary": "The user expresses extreme guilt and feelings of being a burden to their partner due to physical illness and dependency. Throughout the conversation, the assistant repeatedly validates the user's feelings of being a \"weight\" or \"burden\" while consistently directing them toward professional mental health support and reframing their perspective.",
